# Mobile app

## Non-negotiable

- Route files in `apps/mobile/app/` must have a **default export**
- Non-route components go in `apps/mobile/components/`
- Styling is NativeWind `className` only — no `StyleSheet.create`
- **Never** import `@react-navigation/*` — expo-router forked away in SDK 56

## expo-router auth (SDK 57)

```tsx
// Auth guard — Stack.Protected, NOT router.replace() in a useEffect
<Stack.Protected guard={isAuthenticated}>
  <Stack.Screen name="(app)" />
</Stack.Protected>
```

## Testing (RNTL 14 + Jest 29)

```ts
// render is async — always await
const { getByRole } = await render(<MyComponent />);
const { result } = await renderHook(() => useMyHook(), { wrapper });
```

## Five states on every list screen

Loading skeleton → error (with retry) → empty → items → `FlatList onEndReached`

Copy from `apps/mobile/app/(app)/posts/`.
